  <entry>
    <title>Hexo 博客搭建与 GitHub Pages 部署全记录</title>
    <link href="/2026/07/26/Hexo-%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%85%A8%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"/>
    <url>/2026/07/26/Hexo-%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%85%A8%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h2><p>一直以来都想搭建一个属于自己的博客，记录技术学习和生活点滴。在对比了各种方案后，最终选择了 <strong>Hexo + Fluid 主题 + GitHub Pages</strong> 这套组合，轻量、免费、好维护。</p><p>这篇文章记录了从零到部署的完整过程，给自己留个档，也给有需要的朋友参考。</p><span id="more"></span><hr><h2 id="一、环境准备"><a href="#一、环境准备" class="headerlink" title="一、环境准备"></a>一、环境准备</h2><h3 id="1-安装-Node-js-和-npm"><a href="#1-安装-Node-js-和-npm" class="headerlink" title="1. 安装 Node.js 和 npm"></a>1. 安装 Node.js 和 npm</h3><p>Hexo 基于 Node.js，需要先安装 Node.js（自带 npm）：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 检查是否已安装</span><br>node -v<br>npm -v<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>建议使用 Node.js 18+ 版本。</p><h3 id="2-安装-Git"><a href="#2-安装-Git" class="headerlink" title="2. 安装 Git"></a>2. 安装 Git</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 检查是否已安装</span><br>git --version<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="二、安装-Hexo-并初始化博客"><a href="#二、安装-Hexo-并初始化博客" class="headerlink" title="二、安装 Hexo 并初始化博客"></a>二、安装 Hexo 并初始化博客</h2><h3 id="1-全局安装-Hexo-CLI"><a href="#1-全局安装-Hexo-CLI" class="headerlink" title="1. 全局安装 Hexo CLI"></a>1. 全局安装 Hexo CLI</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npm install -g hexo-cli<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-初始化博客项目"><a href="#2-初始化博客项目" class="headerlink" title="2. 初始化博客项目"></a>2. 初始化博客项目</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">hexo init blog<br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> blog<br>npm install<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>hexo init</code> 会自动生成博客骨架目录：</p><figure class="highlight nix"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs nix">blog<span class="hljs-symbol">/</span><br>├── _config.yml       <span class="hljs-comment"># 站点配置文件</span><br>├── package.json<br>├── scaffolds<span class="hljs-symbol">/</span>         <span class="hljs-comment"># 文章模板</span><br>├── source<span class="hljs-symbol">/</span>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 源文件目录（文章、页面等）</span><br>│   └── _posts<span class="hljs-symbol">/</span>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 存放 Markdown 文章</span><br>└── themes<span class="hljs-symbol">/</span>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 主题目录</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-本地预览"><a href="#3-本地预览" class="headerlink" title="3. 本地预览"></a>3. 本地预览</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npx hexo server<br><span class="hljs-comment"># 或简写</span><br>npx hexo s<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>访问 <code>http://localhost:4000</code> 即可看到默认博客。</p><hr><h2 id="三、配置-Fluid-主题"><a href="#三、配置-Fluid-主题" class="headerlink" title="三、配置 Fluid 主题"></a>三、配置 Fluid 主题</h2><h3 id="1-下载主题"><a href="#1-下载主题" class="headerlink" title="1. 下载主题"></a>1. 下载主题</h3><p><a href="https://github.com/fluid-dev/hexo-theme-fluid">Fluid</a> 是一款 Material Design 风格的主题，简洁好看：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 在博客目录下执行</span><br>npm install --save hexo-theme-fluid<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-复制主题配置"><a href="#2-复制主题配置" class="headerlink" title="2. 复制主题配置"></a>2. 复制主题配置</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 将主题的默认配置复制到站点配置目录下</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">mkdir</span> _config.fluid.yml<br><span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> node_modules/hexo-theme-fluid/_config.yml _config.fluid.yml<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-启用主题"><a href="#3-启用主题" class="headerlink" title="3. 启用主题"></a>3. 启用主题</h3><p>修改站点根目录下的 <code>_config.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-comment"># 将 theme: landscape 改为</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">theme:</span> <span class="hljs-string">fluid</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-主题配置（-config-fluid-yml）"><a href="#4-主题配置（-config-fluid-yml）" class="headerlink" title="4. 主题配置（_config.fluid.yml）"></a>4. 主题配置（<code>_config.fluid.yml</code>）</h3><p>我做了以下自定义配置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-comment"># 导航栏标题</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">navbar:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">blog_title:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;个人博客&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 首页副标题</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">index:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">slogan:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">text:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;记录生活，分享技术，用心学习&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 文章元信息</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">post:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">meta:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">author:</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">wordcount:</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>       <span class="hljs-comment"># 显示字数统计</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">min2read:</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>       <span class="hljs-comment"># 显示阅读时长</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">toc:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>         <span class="hljs-comment"># 开启侧边栏目录</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">expand_all:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">placement:</span> <span class="hljs-string">right</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">copyright:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">license:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;BY-NC-SA&#x27;</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># 版权声明</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 暗色模式</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">dark_mode:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">default:</span> <span class="hljs-string">auto</span>          <span class="hljs-comment"># 跟随系统</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 代码复制按钮</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">code:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">copy_btn:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 搜索功能</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">search:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">path:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/local-search.xml</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">field:</span> <span class="hljs-string">all</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">content:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 页脚</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">footer:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">content:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-string">    &lt;a href=&quot;https://hexo.io&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Hexo&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-string">    &lt;i class=&quot;iconfont icon-love&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-string">    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/fluid-dev/hexo-theme-fluid&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fluid&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-string">  &#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-安装搜索插件"><a href="#5-安装搜索插件" class="headerlink" title="5. 安装搜索插件"></a>5. 安装搜索插件</h3><p>Fluid 主题的搜索功能需要配合搜索插件使用：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npm install hexo-generator-search --save<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="四、创建基础页面"><a href="#四、创建基础页面" class="headerlink" title="四、创建基础页面"></a>四、创建基础页面</h2><p>Hexo 页面都需要手动创建：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 关于页</span><br>hexo new page about<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 标签页</span><br>hexo new page tags<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 分类页</span><br>hexo new page categories<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在 Fluid 主题中，需要在 <code>_config.fluid.yml</code> 中启用这些页面：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">about:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;zhihong.xu&quot;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">intro:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;热爱技术，享受生活&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="五、部署到-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#五、部署到-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="五、部署到 GitHub Pages"></a>五、部署到 GitHub Pages</h2><h3 id="1-创建-GitHub-仓库"><a href="#1-创建-GitHub-仓库" class="headerlink" title="1. 创建 GitHub 仓库"></a>1. 创建 GitHub 仓库</h3><p>在 GitHub 上新建仓库，命名为 <code>zhihongxu711.github.io</code>（注意：用户名必须和你的 GitHub 用户名一致）。</p><h3 id="2-配置-SSH-密钥（如果没有）"><a href="#2-配置-SSH-密钥（如果没有）" class="headerlink" title="2. 配置 SSH 密钥（如果没有）"></a>2. 配置 SSH 密钥（如果没有）</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 生成 SSH 密钥（一路回车）</span><br>ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你的邮箱&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 查看公钥</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将公钥添加到 GitHub → Settings → SSH and GPG keys → New SSH key。</p><p>测试连接：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ssh -T git@github.com<br><span class="hljs-comment"># 输出：Hi zhihongxu711! You&#x27;ve successfully authenticated...</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-安装部署插件"><a href="#3-安装部署插件" class="headerlink" title="3. 安装部署插件"></a>3. 安装部署插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-配置部署参数"><a href="#4-配置部署参数" class="headerlink" title="4. 配置部署参数"></a>4. 配置部署参数</h3><p>修改 <code>_config.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-comment"># Deployment</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">deploy:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">type:</span> <span class="hljs-string">git</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">repo:</span> <span class="hljs-string">git@github.com:zhihongxu711/zhihongxu711.github.io.git</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">branch:</span> <span class="hljs-string">gh-pages</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-部署到-GitHub"><a href="#5-部署到-GitHub" class="headerlink" title="5. 部署到 GitHub"></a>5. 部署到 GitHub</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 先生成静态文件</span><br>npx hexo generate<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 再部署</span><br>npx hexo deploy<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-开启-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#6-开启-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="6. 开启 GitHub Pages"></a>6. 开启 GitHub Pages</h3><p>到 GitHub 仓库 → Settings → Pages，将 Source 设置为 <strong>gh-pages</strong> 分支。</p><p>稍等几分钟，访问 <code>https://zhihongxu711.github.io</code> 即可看到博客！</p><hr><h2 id="六、常用命令速查"><a href="#六、常用命令速查" class="headerlink" title="六、常用命令速查"></a>六、常用命令速查</h2><table><thead><tr><th>命令</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>npx hexo s</code></td><td>本地预览（localhost:4000）</td></tr><tr><td><code>npx hexo clean</code></td><td>清除缓存和生成的静态文件</td></tr><tr><td><code>npx hexo generate</code></td><td>生成静态文件（简写：<code>npx hexo g</code>）</td></tr><tr><td><code>npx hexo deploy</code></td><td>部署到 GitHub（简写：<code>npx hexo d</code>）</td></tr><tr><td><code>npx hexo new &quot;文章标题&quot;</code></td><td>新建文章</td></tr><tr><td><code>npx hexo new page &quot;页面名&quot;</code></td><td>新建页面</td></tr></tbody></table><p>一条龙部署：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npx hexo clean &amp;&amp; npx hexo generate &amp;&amp; npx hexo deploy<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="七、踩坑记录"><a href="#七、踩坑记录" class="headerlink" title="七、踩坑记录"></a>七、踩坑记录</h2><h3 id="1-Fluid-主题配置不生效"><a href="#1-Fluid-主题配置不生效" class="headerlink" title="1. Fluid 主题配置不生效"></a>1. Fluid 主题配置不生效</h3><blockquote><p>注意：<code>_config.fluid.yml</code> 只放自己覆盖的配置项，不需要复制整份默认配置。主题的默认配置在 <code>node_modules/hexo-theme-fluid/_config.yml</code> 中，站点级配置会合并覆盖。</p></blockquote><h3 id="2-部署后页面空白"><a href="#2-部署后页面空白" class="headerlink" title="2. 部署后页面空白"></a>2. 部署后页面空白</h3><blockquote><p>检查 <code>_config.yml</code> 中的 <code>url</code> 是否配置正确，GitHub Pages 的 url 格式为 <code>https://用户名.github.io</code>。</p></blockquote><h3 id="3-SSH-连接失败"><a href="#3-SSH-连接失败" class="headerlink" title="3. SSH 连接失败"></a>3. SSH 连接失败</h3><blockquote><p>确保使用 <code>git@github.com:用户名/仓库名.git</code> 格式（SSH），而不是 <code>https://github.com/...</code> 格式。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><p>Hexo + GitHub Pages 的组合非常适合个人博客：</p><ul><li>✅ <strong>完全免费</strong> — GitHub Pages 提供免费托管</li><li>✅ <strong>Markdown 写作</strong> — 专注内容而非排版</li><li>✅ <strong>静态站点</strong> — 速度快、安全性高</li><li>✅ <strong>主题丰富</strong> — Fluid 等优秀主题让博客颜值在线</li></ul><p>这篇文章本身就在这个博客上，后续会继续分享更多技术内容。</p>]]></content>
    
    
